71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1iCUN33cPwoQ7kNvwEd49hl&_nc_oc=AdpiVhZpzQxsk-3wi6DTGwPGXjCnA464d-McZ5g0yFXbGnyZHvN_IQPWze2aNuv3abA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPtJzz3kD5EIWXAqz0Pimx1C9AJE4uS9tan0lvDnHM89Q&oe=6ABFAD39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pzLsqi2o4zIQ7kNvwF_fiR5&_nc_oc=Adr1fp3wdH254-B5SwKRp54ojxUwYdDjTfl3g1_0Cpg2_CiEJPqrdRpXQKChsCcHoHU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOf42bNN30K2GkyxpY_NnkoVduXiGYpd7Gyf5a92HvkHw&oe=6ABFC013"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lST2C0XVqgIQ7kNvwHhKyNN&_nc_oc=Adp53DpYDWN1wLBvJ0aTm-OE-Xg8CLBsKeRJUHciRSGQaYb5TngH1CSmuoVm5LKdUjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN3I4xvATTVBbwz4qP1gdRBW-w7cItI-8H04GjfI_egPw&oe=6ABFBE5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: